Fear the Lord.

00:08:59,100 --> 00:09:00,100
Desire after him.

00:09:00,100 --> 00:09:02,100
Seek after him.

00:09:02,100 --> 00:09:03,100
Just fear.

00:09:03,100 --> 00:09:05,100
Be it away from him.

